Third party portions
--------------------

Parts of this repository are derived from other projects and keep the license
they were released under. The MIT grant above does not extend to them.

* The main method (SRBD model, gait planner, environment and training loop)
  is inherited from RonGenZ by Ronggan Zhang, which this repository is forked
  from at commit 1731453. See https://github.com/RonGenZ/RonGenZ

* The curriculum grid terrain generation in terrain.py and the terrain
  curriculum and robot placement logic in env.py (_assign_rudin_origins,
  _update_terrain_curriculum) are ported from legged_gym.
  Copyright (c) 2021 ETH Zurich, Nikita Rudin. BSD 3 Clause license, which
  continues to apply to those portions. See
  https://github.com/leggedrobotics/legged_gym

* perception/warp_kernels/cam_kernel.py is a trimmed copy of the depth range
  ray casting kernel from the MGDP warp_sensor project and the camera wrapper
  and depth preprocessing under perception/ are adapted from the same project.
  Those files remain under the terms of their upstream project.

* go2_description.urdf describes the Unitree Go2 and originates with Unitree
  Robotics.
